{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/26de77454d56f2abd264dfb892b4c52d.poster.avif?t=1750790517\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/26de77454d56f2abd264dfb892b4c52d.webm?t=1750790517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/26de77454d56f2abd264dfb892b4c52d.mp4?t=1750790517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>CYBER-ASSASSIN\u2122 is an action packed third-person game currently in development by solo developer -CyberWave-, combining hack and slash with shooter mechanics. Join the assassin himself in an epic single player campaign set in a dark, futuristic world where science fiction meets the gritty edge of cyberpunk.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Ultimate Killing Machine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/e73bd58cb04f467e9b49c1d483d7ae28.poster.avif?t=1750790517\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/e73bd58cb04f467e9b49c1d483d7ae28.webm?t=1750790517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/e73bd58cb04f467e9b49c1d483d7ae28.mp4?t=1750790517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>After becoming a cyborg and escaping a Zenith facility, the Cyber-Assassin sets out on a brutal quest for revenge. His target: the Zenith General.<br> <br>To stop him, the General has placed a bounty on his head, unleashing waves of hired mercenaries, Zenith militia, and robotic enforcers. <br><br>Meanwhile, the General initiates his biggest plan yet: Project Gladitoria \u2014 a program that deploys robotic enforcers across every sector of Cyber-City, enforcing total control over its population.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/51afa8ab674b0e53a74b05292c95bd1f.poster.avif?t=1750790517\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/51afa8ab674b0e53a74b05292c95bd1f.webm?t=1750790517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/51afa8ab674b0e53a74b05292c95bd1f.mp4?t=1750790517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>This game combines hack-and-slash combat with tactical shooter gameplay. Engage in intense, close-quarters combat, where you can perform combos, unlock new skills, and execute brutal kills to replenish your health. When the fight moves to a distance, switch to a tactical shooter style, with a diverse arsenal of weapons to choose from, helping you even the odds against your enemies.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2612730?t=1750790517","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2612730?t=1750790517","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/8cf16dab5f57312a051ab3ae1b0c7f7302b0f438/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750790517","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/8cf16dab5f57312a051ab3ae1b0c7f7302b0f438/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750790517","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"CYBER-ASSASSIN\u2122 will contain Blood and Gore, Intense Violence, and Strong Language."},"demos":[{"appid":2679750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/26de77454d56f2abd264dfb892b4c52d.poster.avif?t=1750790517\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/26de77454d56f2abd264dfb892b4c52d.webm?t=1750790517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/26de77454d56f2abd264dfb892b4c52d.mp4?t=1750790517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>CYBER-ASSASSIN\u2122 is an action packed third-person game currently in development by solo developer -CyberWave-, combining hack and slash with shooter mechanics. Join the assassin himself in an epic single player campaign set in a dark, futuristic world where science fiction meets the gritty edge of cyberpunk.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Ultimate Killing Machine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/e73bd58cb04f467e9b49c1d483d7ae28.poster.avif?t=1750790517\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/e73bd58cb04f467e9b49c1d483d7ae28.webm?t=1750790517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612730/extras/e73bd58cb04f467e9b49c1d483d7ae28.mp4?t=1750790517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>After becoming a cyborg and escaping a Zenith facility, the Cyber-Assassin sets out on a brutal quest for revenge. His target: the Zenith General.<br> <br>To stop him, the General has placed a bounty on his head, 